    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present to the market an excellent 4 bedroom family home in the popular Firhouse estate, No. 51 Ferncourt Green.Presented in great condition throughout with features to include 3 bathrooms, a sunnyfacing rear garden and modern finish throughout. No. 51 is well positioned within the estate in a quiet cul de sac overlooking a green and with views of the Dublin Mountains. The property also has great scope to convert and extend the current footprint.The bright and spacious accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway, guest bathroom, living room,dining room and an open plan kitchen. On the first floor there are four generous sized bedrooms, ensuite bathroom and main family bathroom. The rear garden is ideal for entertaining guests or enjoying a BBQ in the summer months. A large driveway to the front provides off street parking for two cars. Ferncourt is mature sought after estate and enjoys the best of both worlds, away from the hustle and bustle in a peaceful setting with expansive views of the Dublin Mountains while still enjoying access to every conceivable amenity. Conveniently located within close proximity of a wide range of shopping centres, primary and secondary schools and the M50 network. The area is very well served by public transport with No.15 Dublin Bus service running to the city centre. Viewing highly recommended."
      },
